  "slug": "instant-millionaire-pie-for-diabetics",
  "name": "Instant Millionaire Pie for Diabetics",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "Quick and delicious, this pie 's secret is the sugar-free vanilla pudding stirred up with milk. Crushed pineapple, whipped topping, and chopped pecans get folded in. And this delightful filling is spooned into a graham cracker crust and chilled.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a medium bowl, whisk together pudding mix and milk. Fold in pineapple, whipped topping, and pecans. Pour mixture into prepared crust. Chill at least 2 hours before serving."
    }
  ],
